on prototype after normal movement and sustained firing input.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/roo-code-action.webp","alt","A red player with a green health bar fires red projectiles toward blue enemies on a tiled SVG field.","https://action-with-ai.mizchi.workers.dev/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86],"Roo Code","links","创作者开发记录",[92],"evidence","section",{"_61":93,"_25":94,"_95":96},"阅读最初的 AI 开发记录","https://zenn.dev/mizchi/articles/game-with-cline","note","The author names Roo Code and Claude 3.5 Sonnet, explains the no-direct-coding constraint and documents the human design and steering role.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[101],{"_61":102,"_25":103,"_95":104},"查看完整动作游戏原型","https://github.com/mizchi/action-with-ai","Complete React/TypeScript project with SVG rendering, movement, collision, combat, shared types, tests and development notes. No repository license file was found in the reviewed tree.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[110],{"_61":111,"_25":74,"_95":112},"Play Action with AI","Early desktop keyboard-and-mouse prototype. WASD moves and holding the mouse button fires; visual polish and a full commercial campaign are outside its scope.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[120],{"_61":121,"_25":94,"_95":-7},"阅读作者的 Roo Code 实验记录","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[126,127,128,129],"Move with WASD, aim with the mouse and hold the mouse button to shoot.","Read the original sequence from rendering and movement through enemy health and attack warnings.","Inspect docs/overview.md, the shared types and combat modules alongside the creator’s discussion of documentation drift.","For local study, install the project dependencies with the documented pnpm setup and run pnpm dev, then change one attack or movement rule.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Mizchi 明确使用 Roo Code（原 Roo Cline）和 Claude 3.5 Sonnet，并禁止人工直接改代码。人类提供基于开发经验的设计、逐步指令和架构约束。原文保留了工作方法与限制，这仍是早期原型。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创